{"timestamp": 1772141349037.017, "start_timestamp": 1772141348985, "page": "pages5/completeInfo/index", "request": {"url": "https://server-test.freeuuu.com/app-api/status/commerce/user/info", "data": {"userId": 1615, "cardId": ""}, "method": "POST", "header": {"content-type": "application/json", "loginCode": "0c1FhpFa10isgL0GqlGa1535QL0FhpFd", "platform": "34", "longitude": 121.397, "latitude": 31.2494, "Authorization": "Bearer d10373d301c94c06923742e54f6aae34"}, "timeout": 120000}, "end_timestamp": 1772141349126, "response": {"data": {"code": 0, "data": {"userId": "1615", "cardId": "1960560586298163202", "address": "上海市青浦区虹桥世界中心E幢3楼301室", "email": "shaokunlun@freeuuu.com", "ipArea": "上海市", "mobile": "17681122999", "name": "邵昆仑测试环境", "nativePlace": {"provinceCode": "31", "province": "上海市", "cityCode": "3101", "city": "市辖区", "areaCode": "310120", "area": "奉贤区"}, "personalIntroduction": "我是一名热爱生活的人🌿，在通勤途中总能感受城市的活力与节奏，简单的日常里藏着治愈的力量✨。我习惯用温暖的音乐陪伴生活🎵，细腻的旋律能捕捉时光里的小美好，让平凡的日子充满诗意。早餐时光是我慢下来的契机⏳，记录每一刻都成为与自己对话的过程，让生活变得更有温度。阅读是我最享受的放松方式📖，书页间的世界总能治愈疲惫，让简单的日子变得丰盈而充实。我坚持每天分享音乐，让忙碌的日常多了份被旋律点亮的快乐✨。工作中，我以积极的心态对待每一个环节💪，在责任中寻找成长的力量，让每一步都走得坚定而踏实。散步时的咖啡香也让我着迷☕，简单的温馨里藏着生活的诗意，让我更加懂得珍惜当下。所有的热爱都在告诉我：认真对", "tag1": "建设理想国", "tag2": "自由追梦人", "wechat": "17681122808", "backUpUrl": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/public/card/template/B-B8.png", "avatar": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/stag/20251205/8c5377eea4f77e6b92207929d13a552f08e2d58145d7a6e04b4182f84ece5b39.jpg", "portraitUrl": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/prod/portrait/20251130/3f67ba0bf35af9dec38ede306e0ecc3b933db966a7c6bb9404cd8bcfca8b9653.png", "nativePlaceName": ["上海市", "市辖区", "奉贤区"], "exchangeStatus": -1, "isMine": 1, "memberStatus": true, "templateId": "9", "styleId": "80", "shareId": "76", "cardIdentityType": null, "currentIdentityId": "", "shareImageUrl": "https://freeuuu.obs.cn-east-3.myhuaweicloud.com/test/image/20260227/fb0a8b2aff566a69e909b376b68fab911d08e68ae77f7e76482af61eb3